Debian packages in the Docker image
  The image is based on python:3.14-slim (Debian) and adds the libraries rsgain and fpcalc need: FFmpeg's
  libavcodec, libavformat, libavutil and libswresample (LGPL and GPL-2-or-later parts), TagLib (LGPL/MPL),
  libebur128, libfmt, libinih (BSD/MIT) and the codec libraries they depend on (LAME, mpg123, Opus, Vorbis, x264,
  x265 and others, under their own licences). Each package ships its licence in /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright
  inside the image. Their complete source is available from Debian: `apt-get source <package>` on a Debian
  system of the same release, or https://sources.debian.org. A written offer: for the GPL and LGPL parts of the
  image, the corresponding source is available on request: open an issue at
  https://github.com/koehntopp/tagwright/issues.
